{
  "title": { "zh": "查出坏帧", "en": "Catch bad frames" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "线会翻位。每帧的内容后面跟一个校验字节（5 个 0，再加整帧内容的 3 位校验码），和内容一起做位填充。逐个给出每帧的内容字节，每个字节在它后面那个字节收全的那一拍给出，同时「收到」为 1；结尾旗标收完的那一拍「帧尾」为 1，「完好」说出这一帧是否完好。其余各拍「字节」「完好」是「—」，「收到」「帧尾」为 0。",
    "en": "The wire flips bits. Each frame's content is followed by a check byte (five 0s, then the 3 check bits of the whole content), stuffed along with it. Give each frame's content bytes one by one, each on the tick the byte after it is complete, with got 1 on that tick; on the tick the closing flag is complete make end 1 and say in intact whether the frame arrived intact. On every other tick the byte and intact are 「—」, got and end 0."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "到这里为止，校验码护着的只是一个字节。一帧有几个字节事先不知道，校验码于是放在整帧的内容后面，补成一个整字节：收的一方要等这一帧收完，才知道哪个字节是校验字节。",
        "en": "So far a check has guarded a single byte. A frame's length is not known in advance, so its check goes after the whole content, padded to a whole byte: the receiver only knows which byte is the check once the frame is over."
      }
    }
  ],
  "wires": { "in": [{ "name": "line", "label": { "zh": "进线", "en": "Wire in" } }] },
  "outputs": [
